{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"'A-and what's wrong with love?'","created_at":"2021-07-23T19:01:27.985000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868206197541584936","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Versil","id":"148682928434577408","is_bot":0,"username":"versil"},"author_id":"148682928434577408","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"Roy walks over to Ed and whispers. \"Psst. What's a Philadelphia?\"","created_at":"2021-07-23T19:01:40.288000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868206249144115270","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"\"My plan is that when mercy, truth, and justice are failing.... the foundations of unity are needed\"","created_at":"2021-07-23T19:01:45.159000Z","edited_at":"2021-07-23T19:02:01.470000Z","id":"868206269574557717","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"'Love your friends, love your family, love the people around you, love the nature around you... or would you rather something based on hate?'","created_at":"2021-07-23T19:01:59.358000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868206329129480252","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"MinaPoe","id":"443806147649208341","is_bot":0,"username":"minapoe"},"author_id":"443806147649208341","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"they whisper back \"Sounds like food\"","created_at":"2021-07-23T19:03:03.184000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868206596835147816","reply_to_id":"868206249144115270","thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"\"Justice and Mercy shouldn't be regarded so lightly. It simply was not up kept. Love simply is not enough for Empire. Far too romantic.\"","created_at":"2021-07-23T19:04:47.896000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868207036029091850","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"'Love for your fellow person, though? Not necessarily romantic.'","created_at":"2021-07-23T19:05:14.235000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868207146502860811","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Versil","id":"148682928434577408","is_bot":0,"username":"versil"},"author_id":"148682928434577408","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"\"I guess it'd be something made from cheese.\"","created_at":"2021-07-23T19:05:39.003000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868207250387402822","reply_to_id":"868206596835147816","thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"\"The stone In hampstead cannot be fixed yet.... and the fear in it is taking over the mercy, truth, and justice.... they are failing... It wont do any good to write words already failing once..... but in dark days such as these... hope and unity.... that's something this city needs.  And unity comes from love and family.... does it not?  A desire to stand with those you trust?\"","created_at":"2021-07-23T19:07:01.818000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868207597738688602","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"\"Unity comes from a mutual need. Love and hope can sustain a person. Not a city. If my process would have been too mechanical and devoid of heart, is this not an over correction ?\"","created_at":"2021-07-23T19:09:32.556000Z","edited_at":"2021-07-23T19:09:51.724000Z","id":"868208229979672617","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"'Why can't a whole city's worth of people unite for a common goal?'","created_at":"2021-07-23T19:10:02.065000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868208353749389333","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
